ionen oder USB-Sticks mit verschiedenen Suchalgorithmen, unterstützt über 400 Dateitypen und ermöglicht eine Vorschau der wiederherstellbaren Daten vor der eigentlichen Wiederherstellung.","name":"O&O DiskRecovery","packageUrl":"https://www.oo-software.com/products/oodiskrecovery","publisher":"O&O Software GmbH","publisherUrl":"https://www.oo-software.com","tags":["Datenwiederherstellung","Dateirettung","Datenrettung","Gelöschte Dateien","Datenträger"]},"en-US":{"description":"Professional data recovery tool that locates and restores lost or deleted files using advanced algorithms.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://docs.oo-software.com/eula-3","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"O&O DiskRecovery is a professional data recovery tool capable of retrieving data lost due to deletion or software errors. It scans hard drives, partitions, or USB sticks using various search algorithms, supports over 400 file types, and allows a preview of recoverable data before restoration.","name":"O&O DiskRecovery","packageUrl":"https://www.oo-software.com/products/oodiskrecovery","publisher":"O&O Software GmbH","publisherUrl":"https://www.oo-software.com","tags":["Data Recovery","File Recovery","Data Restoration","Undelete","Storage"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.oo-software.com","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/o/OO-Software/DiskRecovery/14.0.17/OO-Software.DiskRecovery.yaml","sha256":"2c7051b9b81154b71827db28a50743e385cbb14e9d42ee36c5c0d1cdbda83f3c"},{"path":"manifests/o/OO-Software/DiskRecovery/14.0.17/OO-Software.DiskRecovery.installer.yaml","sha256":"2e39773bf9ead316261c1e24aaf96ccd0aca84ce67badcacab7c6853fe292839"},{"path":"manifests/o/OO-Software/DiskRecovery/14.0.17/OO-Software.DiskRecovery.locale.de-DE.yaml","sha256":"cbb2073b8e966f894be1e4d23b175f353092c7ae8462a06e281126a4acc4f8df"},{"path":"manifests/o/OO-Software/DiskRecovery/14.0.17/OO-